  "evidence": "Genuine Go DownloadService.DownloadSources using the existing narrowed DownloadTargetClient stub and synthetic local file writes. No network, auth, media conversion, progress injection or resume state. Paths normalize only isolated absolute/relative temporary roots.",
  "deferred": [
    "Positive numeric PID and valid Pixiv artwork URLs dispatch to the configured artwork manager, deduplicate IDs, and execute before direct resources; they are valid sources, not invalid direct sources.",
    "Valid Pixiv user URLs expand illustration/manga/ugoira pages; bookmark URLs traverse public bookmark pages. Preserve cancellation and per-kind failures in that later vertical checkpoint.",
    "SDK direct URL resource policy, transport, atomic publication, credentials and real media are outside this application orchestration fixture.",
    "Native Windows filesystem behavior and full CLI/MCP download wiring remain unverified."
  ],
